Marquises.

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:28.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, Seth,
for all of these cars,

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:31.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
all of them, I'm into them -
I've got five of them.

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:33.052 size:78% position:39%
My daughter has one.
