00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:11.991 size:81% position:41%
-Well, on the movie --
This is a great story.

00:03:11.991 --> 00:03:14.861 size:84% position:42%
We were shooting at the
Harvey, Illinois mall.

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:16.429 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
that famous mall scene.

00:03:16.429 --> 00:03:18.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was an abandoned mall
at the time.

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:20.900 size:84% position:42%
The area had suffered
