00:03:31.844 --> 00:03:35.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I saw this path
kind of leading out of the -

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:37.784 size:84% position:42%
out of the, you know,
weed-strewn parking lot

00:03:37.784 --> 00:03:40.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
